 Customer Churn Analysis

## Project Overview
This project analyzes customer churn data to identify the major factors that influence customer churn.

## Tools Used
- Microsoft Excel
- Pivot Tables
- Charts
- Dashboard

## Analysis Performed
- Data cleaning
- Customer churn calculation
- Pivot table analysis
- Churn analysis by contract
- Churn analysis by payment method
- Churn analysis by internet service
- Churn analysis by tenure
- Churn analysis by support calls

## Key Insights
- Overall churn rate is 45.10%.
- Monthly contract customers have higher churn.
- Customers with low tenure show higher churn.
- Fiber internet users have higher churn.
- UPI payment users show higher churn.
- Higher support calls are associated with higher churn in this dataset.

## Project Structure
- Customer_Churn_Analysis.xlsx – Excel analysis, Pivot Tables and Dashboard

